<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Academic Approach | St. Martin's High School at St. Martin's High School, Balanagar, Hyderabad.">
<title><%= title || "Academic Approach | St. Martin's High School" %></title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/Logo.png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.6.0/css/all.min.css">
<style>
.content-page { min-height:58vh; padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem) 6%; background:#f6f1e7; color:#071a2b; }
.content-page .content-inner { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
.content-page .eyebrow { color:#8d702d; font:700 .78rem Inter,sans-serif; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; }
.content-page h1 { font:600 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.6rem) "Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif; margin:.7rem 0 1rem; }
.content-page .gold-rule { width:76px; height:3px; background:#c5a45a; margin:1.4rem 0 2rem; }
.content-page p { max-width:850px; font:400 1rem/1.9 Inter,sans-serif; color:#435160; }
.content-page .content-card { margin-top:2rem; padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.5rem); background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid rgba(197,164,90,.3); border-radius:18px; box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(7,26,43,.06); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="content-page"><div class="content-inner">
<span class="eyebrow">Teaching and learning</span><h1>Our Academic Approach</h1><div class="gold-rule"></div>
<p>Our approach aims to balance strong academic foundations with curiosity, participation, personal responsibility and the development of each learner's potential.</p>
<section class="content-card"><h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:2rem;">Learning with purpose</h2>
<p>Our school encourages curiosity, confidence, responsibility and a strong foundation for lifelong learning. For current information about programmes and school activities, please contact the school office.</p>
<a href="/contact" style="display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem;padding:12px 18px;background:#071a2b;color:#fff;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;">Contact the School <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" style="margin-left:8px;"></i></a>
</section></div></main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body></html>